  "title": "trainmeet.id-1.reviewer-grant",
  "additionalProperties": true,
  "description": "The owner page gives the role Granskare in Catalog to a person, by the verified address\nthey log in to ID with (KONTO-30, ID6).",
  "properties": {
    "email": {
      "maxLength": 254,
